# My Issues

Lists issues in the current repository assigned to you and suggests which ones to focus on.

## Instructions

1. Identify the current repository context
2. List issues assigned to the current user using GitHub CLI or MCP tools
3. Analyze issues by:
   - Age (older issues may need attention)
   - Number of comments (active discussions)
   - Status (open/closed)
4. Suggest issues to focus on based on priority signals
5. Present results in a clear, actionable format
